        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Need to re-evaluate, adjust webinar strategies and timelines based on recent experiences. Despite initial plans, outcomes did not meet expectations, requiring strategic pivots.",
