              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Enhance creative strategies, optimize ad budgets, aiming to reduce cost per lead to 300 INR within a month. This includes reassessing current ad spend and exploring more cost-effective channels.",
