              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "High cost per lead leads to unsustainable budget management. Total spending on Facebook ads reached one lakh INR over three months, without commensurate returns.",
